{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["mcp:tools"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"One link that renders up to 20 of your drawings as files, each with its own choices (format, resolution, aspect, background, hand\u2026; see get_drawing export_options). Opening it in a browser renders them one after another and saves each file to that browser\u2019s downloads; drawings still being drawn are rendered once they finish. Follow it with wait_render.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"drawings":{"items":{"properties":{"aspect":{"enum":["original","16:9","9:16","1:1"],"type":"string"},"background":{"enum":["paper","colour","transparent","layers"],"type":"string"},"colour":{"pattern":"^#[0-9a-f]{6}$","type":"string"},"drawing_id":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"format":{"enum":["mp4","webm","png"],"type":"string"},"hand":{"pattern":"^[\\w-]{1,40}$","type":"string"},"hand_direction":{"enum":["auto","right","bottom"],"type":"string"},"hand_size":{"maximum":1.5,"minimum":0.65,"type":"number"},"hand_tilt":{"maximum":15,"minimum":-15,"type":"integer"},"resolution":{"enum":["original","720p","1080p"],"type":"string"},"skip":{"items":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"timing":{"enum":["keep","trim"],"type":"string"},"trace":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["drawing_id"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":20,"minItems":1,"type":"array"}},"required":["drawings"],"type":"object"},"name":"render_link","title":"Render link"}
